  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://v.blakesmods.com/banners/mysticalcustomization?source=curseforge\" width=\"840\" height=\"168\"></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-agriculture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://blakesmods.com/img/banner/mysticalagriculture_required.png\" width=\"840\" height=\"92\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"display:flex\"><a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fmystical-customization\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/mysticalcustomization/downloads&style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fmystical-customization\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/mysticalcustomization/version&style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fmystical-customization\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/mysticalcustomization/mc_version&style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fdocs%252fmysticalcustomization\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=docs&message=view&color=brightgreen&style=for-the-badge\"> </a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Mystical Customization — это дополнение к <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-agriculture\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mystical Agriculture</a>, позволяющее добавлять и изменять контент.</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Возможности</strong></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Добавление новых культур или редактирование существующих.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Добавление или изменение уровней и типов культур.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Добавление или изменение типов душ мобов.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Вся настройка осуществляется с помощью файлов JSON. <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fdocs%252fmysticalcustomization\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(документация)</a></span></li>\n</ul>",
